  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Animal Health and Veterinary Science Specialist</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To make available to poor livestock farmers in low income countries ( LICs) animal health products that are affordable and suitable to support basic and strategic biological and biotechnological research in animal health that contributes to the achievement of the MDGs through greater understanding of how to combat livestock diseases that affect the livelihoods of poor people.</narrative>
  </description>
